BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Your Plate Squared: Celebrating America’s 250th
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260611
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260824
DTSTAMP:20260810T114513Z
UID:7dec4c536f506019094243f48a07@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Your Plate Squared: Celebrating America’s 250th is a communi
 ty exhibition organized in conjunction with the semiquincentennial of Amer
 ica’s founding. Gathering around food is a part of many holidays in the 
 United States\, including Memorial Day\, Juneteenth\, Independence Day\, a
 nd Thanksgiving . Drawing on these traditions\, Your Plate Squared explore
 s the role that food plays in shaping our individual and national identiti
 es.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/events/your-plate-squared-celebrating-a
 mericas-250th
LOCATION:The Bruce Museum\, Vicki Netter Fitzgerald Works on Paper Gallery
 \, 1 Museum Drive\, Greenwich CT\, 06830
URL:https://ctvisit.com/events/your-plate-squared-celebrating-americas-250
 th
END:VEVENT
